    "done_when": "Defect, found by the certificate-hub gate (run r-20261002T225104739997, log row-base-default-chord-diverted.log): since the frozen-Newton lineage merged (db580bec8), ForwardProfile._solve_accelerated's live-read fallback (nova/equilibrium/forward.py:2074-2080) calls fixed_point.newton_krylov(mapped, ...) on the plain map. It forwards options that carry own_mask_acceptance=True but passes no shadowed map and no promoted shadow masks, so whenever the frozen route does not settle, the guard at fixed_point.py:5015 raises 'ValueError: own-mask acceptance requires promoted shadow masks'. Reproduce it with benchmarks/solovev_certificate.py, CERTIFICATE_CASE=diverted-jump-bearing at the smallest rung, through profile.solve(request). Contract: the live-read fallback runs under the same acceptance policy as the route it backs. When own-mask acceptance is in force, it carries the shadowed map, the shadow mask and the promoted shadow mask exactly as the primary newton_krylov call does (forward.py:2086 and 2106), and its termination stays judged on the live residual and live partition, per the locked live-warmup-frozen-newton decision. Gate, logged under the run directory: (1) a new tests/test_live_read_fallback_acceptance.py forces the fallback (a frozen route that does not settle) with own-mask acceptance on. It asserts that the solve returns a receipt, that the fallback ran (live_partition_reads counted), and the converged flag, and it fails at the dispatch base with that ValueError. (2) The diverted-jump-bearing smallest-rung chord row builds at head, with its terminal residual and converged flag recorded. (3) tests/test_frozen_route_settlement.py, tests/test_one_read_per_trip.py and tests/test_equilibrium_forward_solve.py add no failure against the dispatch base, compared by test id. Run on the H200 through RECKON_ALLOW_NESTED_LAUNCH=1 scripts/nova_lane/run.sh --rungs h200 --force-submit; the coordinator authorises this launch path, and the general fence does not forbid it. Any base tree is a git archive of the base revision restricted to nova tests benchmarks scripts, extracted under /tmp and removed before the manifest is written. Every uv command carries --no-sync and nothing runs uv sync. Write the manifest before any long step, with empty wait fields unless a wait_probe names a job id and wait_terminal names a state the probe prints; its status is one of complete, blocked or failed.",
    "estimated_hours": null,
    "goal": "Run the live-read Newton fallback under the same acceptance policy as the route it backs",
